\f0\fs24 \cf0 These files contain the code for the endemic species analysis, community analysis, and hierarchical partitioning.\
The file \'82Community_analysis.R\'91 contains the code regarding the analysis of differences in community composition and the DCA.\
The file \'82DCA.R\'91 contains the analysis of the DCA which is needed to inform the decision between CCA and RDA.\
The file \'82comparison_endemics.R\'91 contains the analysis of species richness, proportion of endemic and native species between the ecosystems and developments.\
The files \'82var_part_structure.R\'91, \'82var_part_community_composition.R\'91, and \'82var_part_species_richness.R\'91 contain the code used to perform the hierarchical partitioning for structure, community composition, and species richness respectively.}